  "implementation": [
    "Every projection Row carries exact session generation, owner/control Origin; query construction/copy/move preserve Origin. Scoped copies carry unique epoch and pre-existing aliases are denied.",
    "enter_job requires idle selected owned provider, distinct child actor, protected source capability, exact live SessionView/Parent control and expiring JobPermit. Shared Parent lease guards raw Parent metadata, not caller-protected projection/SessionOwner lifetime.",
    "Control freezes shared scoped state under gate, then checks permit and opaque checkpoint outside gate. Actor checks precede Parent entry. Internal callback donor consumed by final receiver swap after field construction.",
    "Scoped query/type/factory/prepare/copy and temporary move/destroy are admitted; protected source move/destroy is denied. Public session/accept/release/close and handler/response scheduling remain original-worker only, before task/functor consumption.",
    "Scope close invalidates permission first, requires no active call/probe and zero scoped temporary rows, revalidates full protected source projection before/after callable retirement, and checks still-live permit. Active callback target retirement is deferred by shared call pin; no speculative failure cleanup.",
    "Profile JobHandoff.clone_environment pins dispatch/Profile/Parent child Operation and exact job claim, executes existing023dd0 clone/query/destroy, then scope retirement. No job completion, message body, closure execution or strong-reference release."
  ],
